Corrective fix: No action required at this time. If the symptom recurs, capture the exact time and run “ip neigh” and a ping from both laptops before any changes; clearing the neighbor cache (ip neigh flush dev eth0) or bouncing the switch access ports would mitigate a transient ARP or link state issue, but there is no current misconfiguration to fix. === END ===